{"about_the_game":"To answer the requests of the fans, here are five new stories of what happens After.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Yumeutsutsu Re:Unification</h2>Follow Ai and Kokoro as they find themselves in charge of creating a fan disc for their successful game. This time, Ai is tasked with the SD arts, while Kororo is tasked with the plot!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deadline rather than paradise</h2>Saki is now relaxed and planning a trip overseas with her lover when a call for help from the second game team comes in: &quot;Our scenarist went AWOL.&quot; What will Saki choose?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ghosts of the Past</h2>Nana, now a successful voice talent and happily wed to Ai, receives a letter from her long-dead mother...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Married Life</h2>Ai and Maria have moved out of the dorm and now live in their own house. But married life is fraught with its own challenges.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Love Story, With Her and the Dog</h2>Ai decided Honoka looked best in her swimsuit, but she seemed so completely out of reach, until...<br><br><br><strong>*Important note*</strong><br>This title is a sequel! Before playing it, we would highly recommend familiarizing yourself with the original story here Yumeutsutsu_ReMaster.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"79c4de166a4a146e00edbac392c071df5b88d177.jpg","localized_name":"Honoka Ending","name":"Honoka Ending","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1267260/79c4de166a4a146e00edbac392c071df5b88d177.jpg"},{"icon":"13a8db789192a3229f9bd7ad04947113cbe89204.jpg","localized_name":"Banako Ending","name":"Banako Ending","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1267260/13a8db789192a3229f9bd7ad04947113cbe89204.jpg"},{"icon":"451e5f0cc172b0cab4274920f76184908a549eca.jpg","localized_name":"Kokoro Ending","name":"Kokoro Ending","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1267260/451e5f0cc172b0cab4274920f76184908a549eca.jpg"},